{
  "page": "RogueSquadron64Recomp.html",
  "header": [
    "Star Wars: Rogue Squadron's regular plan for N64Recomp-browser's play_page.mjs, 2-3 minutes: Load ROM in the page's",
    "launcher, Start Game, the intro (the game takes a skip only near its end), SELECT GAME with A, a new pilot named R, on",
    "to AVAILABLE CRAFT, where the plan sets the mission to the second, Rendezvous on Barkhan, as the port's own",
    "--boot-target level:1 does (the first plays its chapter's 96 s crawl first), A on the X-wing, the mission's opening",
    "cinematic waited out, then about 40 s of the mission:",
    "thrust, blasters, turns each way, climbs and dives, a missile, and the pause menu once. Each press in the menus is",
    "repeated until the screen word at 0x800CDAC4 or the menu id at 0x800CE734 moves; the mission is on once its",
    "objective byte (0x80130B14) is set and the demo bit (0x80130B50) clear."
  ],
  "load": [
